        "detailed_description": "A strange yet succulent incident has begun... Gensokyo is overflowing with snacks! A roguelike twin-stick shooter Touhou Project fangame makes its debut on Steam!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight using the power of snacks!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c6cd1caa737e2c8aa299954171f761c5.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=666 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c6cd1caa737e2c8aa299954171f761c5.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c6cd1caa737e2c8aa299954171f761c5.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/9c7855208d2edecc2c812a4bf32612fc.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=666 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/9c7855208d2edecc2c812a4bf32612fc.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/9c7855208d2edecc2c812a4bf32612fc.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/84281c90e48925e8e64bfb38a0cf255d.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=666 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/84281c90e48925e8e64bfb38a0cf255d.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/84281c90e48925e8e64bfb38a0cf255d.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your danmaku-firing snacks to mow down hordes of enemies. All the different snacks have different upsides and downsides, and will level up and grow stronger as you battle with them!<br>Rumia can also eat snacks to grow stronger permanently, additionally gaining that snack as a passive attack! Eat snacks to become stronger, but be careful not to overeat and get sleepy...!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 100 different items!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/7527ba0be860bfd2d8c403359961748d.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/7527ba0be860bfd2d8c403359961748d.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/7527ba0be860bfd2d8c403359961748d.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once a battle ends, it's time to go shopping! There are a ton of different items to aid Rumia in her journey.<br>There are items that simply raise your stats, ones that summon battle partners that block bullets, and even ones that treat other items like you have two of them...!?<br>There's a whole variety pack of items to choose from, but don't forget to pick ones that synergize with your other items... and your snacks too, of course!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn the tables with talismans!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/8ac79377a40fd539f3a82fbbf52594ad.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/8ac79377a40fd539f3a82fbbf52594ad.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/8ac79377a40fd539f3a82fbbf52594ad.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spirit Strike Talismans can be used in battle and offer a wide range of helpful effects, such as dealing big damage and blasting away enemies, or buffing Rumia for a period of time.<br>Depending on your inventory of items, you might even find your battle tactics revolving around your talismans!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will Gensokyo ever go &quot;snack&quot; to normal?</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c4df8ce51d9aa6fe9597f05eba76857d.avif?t=1761490817\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>Snack Fountains have suddenly appeared around Gensokyo, and territory struggles have erupted around them... yet, nobody seems all that concerned!?<br>Entering an event space lets you take a look at how the other residents of Gensokyo are doing, and maybe even offer them some help! Maybe you'll figure out something about the ongoing incident, too?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The biscuits can get harder!?</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/1543ba2ca5a6498bbeb99f1855c49842.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=764 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/1543ba2ca5a6498bbeb99f1855c49842.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/1543ba2ca5a6498bbeb99f1855c49842.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Change the game's Biscuit Hardness to make things easier or harder! You'll unlock harder and harder difficulties as you keep winning runs.<br>But don't worry — you can always make things easier if you feel like the game is too difficult!",
        "about_the_game": "A strange yet succulent incident has begun... Gensokyo is overflowing with snacks! A roguelike twin-stick shooter Touhou Project fangame makes its debut on Steam!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight using the power of snacks!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c6cd1caa737e2c8aa299954171f761c5.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=666 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c6cd1caa737e2c8aa299954171f761c5.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c6cd1caa737e2c8aa299954171f761c5.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/9c7855208d2edecc2c812a4bf32612fc.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=666 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/9c7855208d2edecc2c812a4bf32612fc.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/9c7855208d2edecc2c812a4bf32612fc.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/84281c90e48925e8e64bfb38a0cf255d.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=666 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/84281c90e48925e8e64bfb38a0cf255d.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/84281c90e48925e8e64bfb38a0cf255d.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your danmaku-firing snacks to mow down hordes of enemies. All the different snacks have different upsides and downsides, and will level up and grow stronger as you battle with them!<br>Rumia can also eat snacks to grow stronger permanently, additionally gaining that snack as a passive attack! Eat snacks to become stronger, but be careful not to overeat and get sleepy...!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 100 different items!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/7527ba0be860bfd2d8c403359961748d.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/7527ba0be860bfd2d8c403359961748d.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/7527ba0be860bfd2d8c403359961748d.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once a battle ends, it's time to go shopping! There are a ton of different items to aid Rumia in her journey.<br>There are items that simply raise your stats, ones that summon battle partners that block bullets, and even ones that treat other items like you have two of them...!?<br>There's a whole variety pack of items to choose from, but don't forget to pick ones that synergize with your other items... and your snacks too, of course!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn the tables with talismans!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/8ac79377a40fd539f3a82fbbf52594ad.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/8ac79377a40fd539f3a82fbbf52594ad.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/8ac79377a40fd539f3a82fbbf52594ad.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spirit Strike Talismans can be used in battle and offer a wide range of helpful effects, such as dealing big damage and blasting away enemies, or buffing Rumia for a period of time.<br>Depending on your inventory of items, you might even find your battle tactics revolving around your talismans!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will Gensokyo ever go &quot;snack&quot; to normal?</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/c4df8ce51d9aa6fe9597f05eba76857d.avif?t=1761490817\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>Snack Fountains have suddenly appeared around Gensokyo, and territory struggles have erupted around them... yet, nobody seems all that concerned!?<br>Entering an event space lets you take a look at how the other residents of Gensokyo are doing, and maybe even offer them some help! Maybe you'll figure out something about the ongoing incident, too?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The biscuits can get harder!?</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/1543ba2ca5a6498bbeb99f1855c49842.poster.avif?t=1761490817\" width=764 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/1543ba2ca5a6498bbeb99f1855c49842.webm?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619760/extras/1543ba2ca5a6498bbeb99f1855c49842.mp4?t=1761490817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Change the game's Biscuit Hardness to make things easier or harder! You'll unlock harder and harder difficulties as you keep winning runs.<br>But don't worry — you can always make things easier if you feel like the game is too difficult!",
